stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending
    Pending --> Running
    Running --> Reviewing
    Reviewing --> Validating
    Validating --> Evaluating
    Evaluating --> AwaitingApproval
    AwaitingApproval --> ReadyForMerge
    Reviewing --> Retrying
    Validating --> Retrying
    Evaluating --> Retrying
    Retrying --> Running
    Running --> Failed
    Retrying --> Exhausted
    AwaitingApproval --> Rejected
    ReadyForMerge --> [*]
